{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish Season</strong> is a casual fishing game where you catch fish and battle rival fishermen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fishing season is open, and everyone is competing for the most profitable catches. In <strong>Fish Season</strong>, fish are everything\u2014the entire game runs on a fish-based economy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail to the dock for quick and useful upgrades. And when you're in trouble, fire some fish at your enemies\u2014just try not to make too much of a mess, okay?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and don\u2019t forget to collect the spoils from your sunken foes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602600/extras/2a4cd28c2c20168b63d884154a44ca2c.avif?t=1750506186\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602600/extras_big/2a4cd28c2c20168b63d884154a44ca2c.avif?t=1750506186 width=800 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fishing License","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602600/a859c984db3aa50a1fa00fd1431cc01deb28820c.jpg"},{"name":"First Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602600/5e448ea8e8480ee49adc502c8eff73787a3da2ad.jpg"},{"name":"Small Adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602600/3bed9e4d779641f4edbd25414fcb8eec536faf48.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Sailor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602600/2908105ed594871bb1df35700355d6dd2467924b.jpg"},{"name":"World Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602600/0f6f2359a4e02f87976b364376dd8071028b78d1.jpg"},{"name":"First Batch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub